# SoundPlant demo: hiphop, 90 BPM, D dorian. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# A boom bap track in D Dorian. A Rhodes loop (Dm9 to G9, the Dorian IV with its natural B) is answered by a horn stab on the
# and of 2 and the and of 4, over a walking finger bass and a heavy swung break. Mid-song the beat switches (half-time snare, double-time
# hats, the horn on a 3-3-2) and a voice is scratched; a beatless strings bridge (Bbmaj7 | A7 altered) rewinds back into Dm9;
# the last verse doubles the horn an octave up; the Rhodes and the vinyl are left to play it out.
# T1 kit  T2 knit finger bass  T3 rayon mellow ep  T4 sample horn stab  T5 sample strings  T6 sample vinyl  T7 rayon glass bell
# T8 voile vocal chop, scratched with bend, multiply and glide tricks
# Song: intro 4, hook 4, verse 8, hook 4, verse 8, hook 4, switch 8, bridge 8, last verse 8, final hook 8, outro 8.
bpm 90
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 2
knob 9 e3 2

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the kit: a crushed x kick, a cracking x snare with a clap on it, tight hats, a rim tick; an old-sampler grain over all of it
knob 1 d1.model x_kick
knob 1 d1.k1 37
knob 1 d1.k2 44
knob 1 d1.k3 44
knob 1 d1.k4 96
knob 1 d1.k5 46
knob 1 d1.k6 24
knob 1 d1.k7 74
knob 1 d1.volume 76
knob 1 d2.model x_snare
knob 1 d2.k1 56
knob 1 d2.k2 42
knob 1 d2.k3 104
knob 1 d2.k4 84
knob 1 d2.k5 127
knob 1 d2.k6 44
knob 1 d2.k7 66
knob 1 d2.volume 92
knob 1 d2.send2 66
knob 1 d3.k2 16
knob 1 d3.volume 100
knob 1 d4.k2 40
knob 1 d4.volume 100
knob 1 d5.model x_clap
knob 1 d5.k1 100
knob 1 d5.k2 44
knob 1 d5.k3 60
knob 1 d5.volume 86
knob 1 d5.send2 58
knob 1 d6.volume 84
knob 1 d7.volume 80
knob 1 d8.volume 74
knob 1 d9.volume 60
knob 1 d10.model x_rim
knob 1 d10.volume 90
knob 1 ctype sampler
knob 1 camt 48
knob 1 ctone 90
knob 1 cmix 100
knob 1 level 92
# T2 a knit finger bass, soft and round: the fundamental is what a walking line needs, a little tape on top
preset 2 finger_bass knit
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain 2
knob 2 cut 66
knob 2 ctype tape
knob 2 camt 40
knob 2 level 90
# T3 a rayon mellow electric piano: the Rhodes loop, in the room
preset 3 mellow_ep rayon
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain 2
knob 3 level 100
knob 3 pan 50
knob 3 send1 8
knob 3 send2 26
# T4 the horn stab: a sampled brass section, a notch of drive, a short echo
preset 4 horn_stab sample
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 brain 2
knob 4 ctype drive
knob 4 camt 40
knob 4 level 124
knob 4 pan 78
knob 4 send1 26
knob 4 send2 14
# T5 sampled strings: the bridge's held chords, the final hook's swell
preset 5 strings sample
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 brain 2
knob 5 level 80
knob 5 pan 64
knob 5 send2 44
# T6 the vinyl run-out groove under everything, low
preset 6 vinyl sample
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain 2
knob 6 bend octave
knob 6 level 84
# T7 a rayon glass bell: the glint in the gaps, into the echo
preset 7 glass_bell rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain 2
knob 7 level 88
knob 7 pan 92
knob 7 send1 40
knob 7 send2 30
# T8 a voile vocal chop played as a scratch: mono, a nasal band-pass, crushed, bends an octave either way
preset 8 vocal_chop voile
param 8 oct 2
knob 8 brain 2
knob 8 vmode mono
knob 8 porta 14
knob 8 bend octave
knob 8 d 100
knob 8 s 100
knob 8 r 24
knob 8 ftype bp12
knob 8 cut 84
knob 8 res 44
knob 8 ctype crush
knob 8 camt 34
knob 8 ctone 70
knob 8 level 98
knob 8 pan 38
knob 8 send1 34
knob 8 send2 16
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo, FX II a short room
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 108
knob 11 e3 46
knob 11 e4 44
knob 12 engine room
knob 12 e2 70
knob 12 e3 50
mst lo 64
mst hi 44
mst comp 54
mst pump 0
mst release 74
mst level 108
groove swing

