# ---- scenes and the song: the mask is T1..T8, COND, THROW; x = muted
# intro: the Rhodes alone with the vinyl and a bell, a flick and a stab on the last beat
scenedef 1 8 1 2 5 1 1 1 6 1 1
scenemute 1 .x..x.....
# hook: the break, the walking bass, the loop answered by the horn
scenedef 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 2 1 1 1
scenemute 2 ....x..x..
# verse 1a: the kit steps back, the bass holds roots and fifths
scenedef 3 2 2 2 2 1 1 3 1 1 1
scenemute 3 ...xx..x..
# verse 1b: the bass walks, the horn answers, a scratch into the hook
scenedef 4 3 7 2 2 1 1 3 1 1 1
scenemute 4 ....x.....
# hook: again, the end of the phrase into the echo
scenedef 5 1 1 1 1 1 1 2 1 1 2
scenemute 5 ....x..x..
# verse 2a: the Rhodes leaves long chords and soft answers
scenedef 6 2 2 3 2 1 1 3 1 1 1
scenemute 6 ...xx..x..
# verse 2b: the walk and the scratch again
scenedef 7 3 7 3 2 1 1 3 1 1 1
scenemute 7 ....x.....
# hook: the bass pushes with octave pops, the drums build into the switch
scenedef 8 1 3 1 1 1 1 2 1 1 3
scenemute 8 ....x.....
# switch A: half-time snare, double-time hats, the horn on a 3-3-2, Dm9 | Em7 | Fmaj7 | G9, the scratch chops the a of every beat
scenedef 9 4 4 4 3 1 1 4 2 1 1
scenemute 9 ....x.....
# switch B: the scratch routine, the toms, the build into the bridge
scenedef 10 5 4 4 3 1 1 4 3 1 4
scenemute 10 ....x.....
# bridge A: no drums; strings hold Bbmaj7 and A7b9, the Rhodes is thinned to a note, the bass walks
scenedef 11 1 5 5 1 1 1 5 1 1 1
scenemute 11 x..x...x..
# bridge B: the Rhodes is out, the bass walks alone; a rewind throw and the snare roll back into Dm9
scenedef 12 6 6 5 1 2 2 5 4 1 5
scenemute 12 ..xx......
# last verse A: the full band, the horn doubled an octave up
scenedef 13 3 7 1 4 1 1 2 1 1 1
scenemute 13 ....x..x..
# last verse B: the same, the scratch into the final hook
scenedef 14 3 7 1 4 1 1 2 5 1 1
scenemute 14 ....x.....
# final hook A: the heaviest break, strings swelling under the doubled horn
scenedef 15 7 3 1 4 3 1 2 5 1 1
scenemute 15 ..........
# final hook B: the same, the last hook rings into the echo as the drums stop dead
scenedef 16 7 3 1 4 3 1 2 5 1 7
scenemute 16 ..........
# outro A: no drums; the Rhodes loop, the bass, the strings, the vinyl
scenedef 17 1 2 1 1 4 1 6 1 1 1
scenemute 17 x..x...x..
# outro B: the Rhodes loop and the vinyl, ringing into the echo
scenedef 18 1 1 1 1 4 1 6 1 1 6
scenemute 18 xx.x...x..
song 1:4 2:4 3:4 4:4 5:4 6:4 7:4 8:4 9:4 10:4 11:4 12:4 13:4 14:4 15:4 16:4 17:4 18:4
songloop 0
expect lanes <65

# ---- play the song (HOME, SELECT to the Song page, PLAY)
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav soundplant_demo_hiphop.wav
tap PLAY
bars 72
wait 3000
wavstop
stats
